Subject: [PATCH 3/8] x86/ticketlock: collapse a layer of functions
Date: Fri,  2 Sep 2011 16:54:10 -0700
Message-Id: <e3c122199b2645f052a211e697457e9623f69c01.1315007226.git.jeremy.fitzhardinge@citrix.com>
